{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13808","headline":"寄江南鹤林寺石冰上人 · 顾况","name":"寄江南鹤林寺石冰上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山川重复出，心地闇相逢。\n忽忆秋江月，如闻古寺钟。\n湖平南北岸，云抱两三峰。\n定力超香象，真言摄毒龙。\n风中何处鹤，石上几年松。\n爲报烟霞道，人间共不容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}